  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency preparedness and Response to households affected by disaster in Unity State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">110876</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Preparedness and response activities in Unity State will target the most vulnerable groups affected by disaster by complementing the existing food distributions with resumption of food production, provision of  Non-Food Items, improved access to WASH services affected by the floods and the strengthening of preparedness and disaster risk reduction capacities. Those activities will be carried out in Unity state through static and mobile responses in several counties.</narrative>
  </description>
